  "storyId": "B-a2a6",
  "name": "cache-review-prompt-envelopes-in-readiness",
  "title": "Cache the prompt-envelope snapshot across reviewer evidence readiness checks",
  "description": "Runtime preflight currently reparses the same prompt-envelopes.json ledger once per bound reviewer run while collecting REVIEW evidence. On 2026-08-24, B-dc83 produced a repeatable multi-minute stall and prevented the official REVIEW-to-DEV transition. Reuse one immutable in-memory snapshot per evidence collection and pass it through incremental verification without weakening integrity, signature, scope, freshness, or task-semantic checks. The user-visible outcome is a faster and more predictable lifecycle readiness gate with identical evidence decisions.",
  "type": "bug",
  "phase": "DONE",
